    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">IMMZD18SDTPTdWCBA</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-IMMZD18SDTPTdWCBA.html\">UG.IMMZ.D18.S.DTP.Td women of childbearing age schedule</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">UG.IMMZ.D18.S.DTP.Td women of childbearing age schedule</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-10-16 12:13:43+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">litlfred (draft for UNEPI review)</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>UG.IMMZ.D18.S.DTP.Td women of childbearing age schedule\nTetanus and diphtheria (Td) vaccination schedule for women of childbearing age (15-49 years), Uganda</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Knowledge Capability: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                computable \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Jurisdiction: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">UG</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Related Artifacts: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                \n                <p><b>References</b></p>\n                <ul>\n                    \n                    <li><div><p>WHO recommendations for routine immunization - summary tables (January 2025)</p>\n</div><br/><a href=\"\"/></li>\n                    \n                    <li><div><p>Ministry of Health, Uganda. Uganda Routine Immunisation Schedule; UNEPI, User requirements for SMART Guidelines (library/ of smart-immunizations-uganda)</p>\n</div><br/><a href=\"\"/></li>\n                    \n                </ul>\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Libraries: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><a href=\"Library-IMMZD18SDTPTdWCBALogic.html\">IMMZD18SDTPTdWCBALogic</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Td dose 1:</b> Provision of Td dose 1 for a woman of childbearing age\nTrigger event: Client is female, aged 15-49 years, and no Td dose was administered\nTrigger date: &quot;Contact date&quot;\nCreate condition: At first contact.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            Td dose 1\n                            \n                            <i>(Td dose 1)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            <b>Then:</b> <i>Definition:</i> <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/litlfred/smart-immunizations/ActivityDefinition-IMMZD2DTCR.html\">http://smart.who.int/immunizations/ActivityDefinition/IMMZD2DTCR</a><br/>\n                            \n                            <i>Dynamic Values:</i><br/>\n                            \n                            status: <i>('active')</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            payload.contentString: <i>(Td dose 1 Create)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            category.coding: <i>(Code { system: 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/communication-category', code: 'alert' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            priority: <i>(Code { system: 'http://hl7.org/fhir/request-priority', code: 'routine' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Td dose 2:</b> Provision of Td dose 2 for a woman of childbearing age\nTrigger event: First Td dose was administered\nTrigger date: Latest &quot;Date and time of vaccination&quot; (where &quot;Vaccine type&quot; = &quot;Tetanus and diphtheria-containing vaccines&quot;)\nCreate condition: 1 month after dose 1.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            Td dose 2\n                            \n                            <i>(Td dose 2)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            <b>Then:</b> <i>Definition:</i> <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/litlfred/smart-immunizations/ActivityDefinition-IMMZD2DTCR.html\">http://smart.who.int/immunizations/ActivityDefinition/IMMZD2DTCR</a><br/>\n                            \n                            <i>Dynamic Values:</i><br/>\n                            \n                            status: <i>('active')</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            payload.contentString: <i>(Td dose 2 Create)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            category.coding: <i>(Code { system: 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/communication-category', code: 'alert' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            priority: <i>(Code { system: 'http://hl7.org/fhir/request-priority', code: 'routine' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Td dose 3:</b> Provision of Td dose 3 for a woman of childbearing age\nTrigger event: Second Td dose was administered\nTrigger date: Latest &quot;Date and time of vaccination&quot; (where &quot;Vaccine type&quot; = &quot;Tetanus and diphtheria-containing vaccines&quot;)\nCreate condition: 6 months after dose 2.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            Td dose 3\n                            \n                            <i>(Td dose 3)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            <b>Then:</b> <i>Definition:</i> <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/litlfred/smart-immunizations/ActivityDefinition-IMMZD2DTCR.html\">http://smart.who.int/immunizations/ActivityDefinition/IMMZD2DTCR</a><br/>\n                            \n                            <i>Dynamic Values:</i><br/>\n                            \n                            status: <i>('active')</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            payload.contentString: <i>(Td dose 3 Create)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            category.coding: <i>(Code { system: 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/communication-category', code: 'alert' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            priority: <i>(Code { system: 'http://hl7.org/fhir/request-priority', code: 'routine' })</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Td dose 4:</b> Provision of Td dose 4 for a woman of childbearing age\nTrigger event: Third Td dose was administered\nTrigger date: Latest &quot;Date and time of vaccination&quot; (where &quot;Vaccine type&quot; = &quot;Tetanus and diphtheria-containing vaccines&quot;)\nCreate condition: 12 months after dose 3.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            Td dose 4\n                            \n                            <i>(Td dose 4)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n    